 "_readme": [
  "Reply catalogue: one spoken clip per (key, slot values) combination.",
  "scripts/gen_reply_audio.py expands each key's slot domains (explicit \"values\" or \"domain\": range:a:b | condition) and renders replies/<file> with Piper.",
